{title: 694 - Praise God, From Whom All Blessings}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #694 • OLD HUNDREDTH • 8.9.9.8.2}
{lyricist: Thomas Ken}
{composer: Louis Bourgeois}
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 694}
{meta: tune OLD HUNDREDTH}
{meta: meter 8.9.9.8.2}
{meta: category Sentences and Responses - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]Praise God, from Whom [D/F#]all blessings [Em]flow;
[Bm/D]Praise Him, all [G]creatures [D/A]here [G/B]below;
[G/B]Praise Him above, ye heavenly [D7/A]host;
[D7/A]Praise Father, [G]Son, [C]and [G/B]Holy [D/A]Ghost.
[D/A](Amen.)
{end_of_verse}
